istration : 7500</p>\n\n<p>Suggested Pages:</p>\n\n<p>Home<br />\nAbout Us<br />\nServices (e.g., Residential, Commercial, Renovations)<br />\nProjects/Portfolio<br />\nClient Testimonials<br />\nContact Us (with form, map, and contact details)</p>\n\n<p>Husna M S<br />\nManager-Marketing<br />\n9999999999 - dummy@programers.in</p>','','Test remarks','2026-06-24 11:59:09.000000','2026-06-24 11:59:09.000000',6,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,'','','','',NULL,'',NULL,'Pending','',NULL,NULL,1),('QTN366524062026A','LD-003665','','Nambeeshan Lodge','9846870666','','HOME STAY','Triprayar','HUSNA','DARSANA','','24 Jun 2026','Not Sent','20000','2000','18000','INR (₹)','18000','<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>To, </p>\r\n\r\n<p>                                                                                                                                19th June 2026</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Managing Director</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nambeesans Lakshmi Lodge, Thriprayar, Thrissur</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sub: - Website Redesign Quotation<strong> </strong>Nambeesans Lakshmi Lodge</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Domain + Server + SSL Cost   </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Domian And Server Registration for one year Cost: Already registered</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SSL Certificate Cost INR 3500: NA</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Website Development – Static</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h1>We propose to design and develop a professional, mobile-friendly website for Nambeesans Lakshmi Lodge.</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Features Included:</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Home Page</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* About Us</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Facilities</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Gallery</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>* Tarrif</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Restaurants</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Contact Page</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Restaurant page/section will be developed as a Dynamic page for easy image updates.</h1>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Pricing</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Website Development: â‚¹20,000    </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Discount                        : â‚¹2,000    </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Final Amount                 â‚¹18,000</h1>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Google Business Profile Management</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Management of 2 Google Business Profiles including:</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Profile Updates</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Photo Uploads</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Review Monitoring</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>* Performance Optimization</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>Monthly Charge: â‚¹5,000</h1>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<h1> </h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><em>Terms & Conditions</em></strong><strong><em>  </em></strong> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong> </strong> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Support: </strong>Full support will be provided to you via Internet, Email, Phone to start running of existing website. (not related Data) Product License:  Installation in one server only.<strong> </strong>  </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong> </strong> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Delivery: </strong>Within 20 days from the Order Date <strong> </strong> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Payment:  75</strong>% advance should be made on signing of contract and balance 25% will be 1st demo of the software.  All the payments should be done through Demand draft or Cheque payable to “PROGRAMERS  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>International, Thrissur.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong> </strong> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Renewal Of Server space/hosting: </strong>In addition to the AMC, yearly domain and database, server space renewal amount to be paid in Advance., 1 GB dedicated Server Space high speed c3 Server with Limited Bandwidth (Approximately 250MB), Database – MySQL- excluding the tax) The charges for server space will be started on the day of registration of the domain, irrespective of the site hosting date. The renewal charges for the website includes domain renewal and server space charges is to be paid 30 days before expiry date of the domain. The rates for domain renewal and server space may change if ICANN makes a change in their charges or as per the change in Currency rates of Indian Rupees with US Dollars.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>  </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Taxes and Duties:</strong>  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The total price for the contract does not include any taxes or other fees payable to the government. If the government in the future levies any tax, fee or other outgoings, the same shall have to be borne by the client.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>','','TEST','2026-06-24 14:02:16.000000','2026-06-24 14:02:16.000000',6,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,'','','','',NULL,'',NULL,'Pending','',NULL,NULL,1),('QTN370809062026A','LD-003708','','Athul Energy','9495951442','info@athulenergy.com','INDUSTRIES','','Husna','Darsana','','9 Jun 2026','Not Sent','48000','0','48000','INR (₹)','Telecalling','<p>To, <br />\r\n                                                                                                                                                                  <br />\r\nThe Managing Director<br />\r\nAthul Energy, Thrissur</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nSub: - Website Redesign & Modernization Proposal </p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nProject Description<br />\r\nThis quotation is submitted for the redesign and modernization of the existing Athul Energy website, originally developed in 2019.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThe proposed work includes upgrading the website with a modern, responsive, and userfriendly design while retaining all existing functionalities and dynamic management features.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nScope of Work</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n# Website Pages Included</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n* Home<br />\r\n* About Us<br />\r\n* Services<br />\r\n* Testimonials<br />\r\n* News & Events<br />\r\n* Downloads<br />\r\n* Contact Us</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nExisting Dynamic Features Included<br />\r\n1. Downloads Management Section<br />\r\n2. Client Logo Management<br />\r\n3. News & Events Management</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nRedesigning Cost: 48000/-</p>','','','2026-06-09 16:50:23.000000','2026-06-09 16:56:17.000000',6,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,'','','','',NULL,'',NULL,'Pending','',NULL,NULL,1),('QTN382202072026B','LD-003822','','SREE DURGA DEVI TEMPLE','9526979513','','TEMPLE','Thrissur','SANDRA . GEORGE','SANDRA . GEORGE','','2 Jul 2026','Not Sent','73000','0','73000','INR (₹)','Telecalling','<p><strong>PROPOSAL FOR WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT & ONLINE VAZHIPADU BOOKING SYSTEM</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you for giving us the opportunity to submit this proposal for your website development and online booking system. Based on your requirements, we have prepared the following scope and costing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. Website Designing and Hosting</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Scope of Work:<br />\r\n- Static Website Design with modern and responsive layout<br />\r\n- New Home Page Design with 2D jQuery based scripting using JavaScript<br />\r\n- Technologies: HTML, CSS, XML integration<br />\r\n- Mobile Responsive Design - Optimized for all devices<br />\r\n- Google Map Integration using Geolocation API<br />\r\n- Static/Dynamic Page Design as per requirements<br />\r\n- Standard Links: About, Contact, Gallery, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong> Investment: â‚¹25,000</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Online Vazhipadu Booking System</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Modules Included:<br />\r\n- Devotee Registration - User signup and profile management<br />\r\n- Vazhipadu Details with Tariff - Complete list with rates<br />\r\n- Prathishta Details - Deity wise information management<br />\r\n- Pooja Booking by Prathishta Wise - Select deity and book poojas<br />\r\n- Daily Booking Statements - Prathishta and Pooja wise reports<br />\r\n- Daily Income Statements - Cash and Bank transaction reports</p>\r\n\r\n<p> <strong>Investment: â‚¹48,000</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong> Total Project Cost: â‚¹73,000</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>','','','2026-07-02 15:41:44.000000','2026-07-02 16:13:03.000000',6,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,'','','','',NULL,'',NULL,'Pending','',NULL,NULL,2),('QTN382227062026A','LD-003822','','SREE DURGA DEVI TEMPLE','9526979513','','TEMPLE','Thrissur','Sandra','Sandra','','27 Jun 2026','Not Sent','53400','0','53400','INR (₹)','TELECALL','<p><strong>BUSINESS PROPOSAL: CLOUD-BASED TEMPLE MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE & WEBSITE</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Subject: Proposal for Cloud Software, Website Development, Server, Domain, and SSL Implementation</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. Core Features & Facilities</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>A. Cloud Software Features</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Malayalam Receipt Printing: Print devotee names and complete Vazhipadu receipts accurately in Malayalam.<br />\r\n* Easy to Operate: Simple, intuitive user interface designed for temple staff with minimal computer knowledge.<br />\r\n* Advance Pooja Booking: Facility to book and schedule poojas and offerings for future dates.<br />\r\n* Poojari Booking List: Easily generate and print daily or upcoming pooja lists directly for the Poojari.<br />\r\n* Prathishta-Wise Report: Print dedicated booking and financial reports filtered by each deity (Prathishta).<br />\r\n* Flexible Tariff Management: Admin facility to change and update Vazhipadu tariff rates instantly.<br />\r\n* Bulk Vazhipadu Booking: Fast-track inputs to handle multiple bookings and bulk devotee registrations simultaneously.<br />\r\n* User Permission Settings: Secure access control with role-based permissions for different staff members.<br />\r\n* Shift-Wise Financials: Real-time visibility into daily income statements sorted by operational shifts.<br />\r\n* Daily Income Statements: Comprehensive end-of-day financial summaries and reporting.<br />\r\n* E-Hundi & UPI Integration: Digital collection facility for Hundi (Kanikka) and Vazhipadu payments using UPI/QR codes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>B. Web & Infrastructure Inclusions</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Official Temple Website: A dedicated public portal showcasing temple history, timings, festivals, and notifications.<br />\r\n* Cloud Server Space: High-speed, secure hosting infrastructure to run both the website and management software seamlessly.<br />\r\n* Domain Name Registration: Registration of a custom domain name (e.g., yourtemplename.com).<br />\r\n* SSL Certificate Security: Secure Sockets Layer (SSL) encryption to ensure \"HTTPS\" security, protecting sensitive data.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<strong> 2. Financial Estimate (Itemized Split</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Cloud Software License & Implementation (Vazhipadu registration, advanced booking, reports, user control) - â‚¹ 30,000/- 2. Official Website Development (Public portal, history, notifications, temple gallery) - â‚¹ 12,000/- <br />\r\n3. Cloud Server Space (1 Year Validity) (High-speed secure hosting for software & website) - â‚¹ 6,000/- <br />\r\n4. Domain Name Registration (1 Year Validity) (Custom web address registration) -  â‚¹ 1,900/- <br />\r\n5. SSL Certificate Security (1 Year Validity) (HTTPS secure encryption setup) - â‚¹ 3500/- <br />\r\n    TOTAL PACKAGE COST =  â‚¹ 53,400/- </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. SMS Gateway Charges</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Complimentary Offer: 1,000 free SMS credited at the time of initial software implementation.<br />\r\n* Standard Tariff: Post-complimentary usage will be charged at 19 Paisa per SMS.</p>','','','2026-06-27 15:23:16.000000','2026-06-27 16:09:29.000000',6,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,'','','','',NULL,'',NULL,'Pending','',NULL,NULL,1),('QTN383920062026A','LD-003839','','Dummy company 1','9447737955','','ACADEMIES','Thrissur','Husna','Karthika','','20 Jun 2026','Not Sent','26000','1000','25000','INR (₹)','Test','<p>Greetings From Programers!!! </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dear Sir,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are delighted to submit a quotation for Dummy company, comprising the following modules:<br />\r\n    <br />\r\n1. Stock Management<br />\r\n          -Sales<br />\r\n          -Purchase<br />\r\n          -Sales Return <br />\r\n  